  "goodToKnow": "Das Lehramt is the teaching profession or teacher training: Lehramt studieren (to train as a teacher, usually two subjects), das Lehramt an Gymnasien. After a university degree (Staatsexamen or Master of Education), German teachers complete a Referendariat, a paid practical traineeship of 12 to 24 months. In the Catholic Church, das Lehramt is the Magisterium. Plural: die Lehrämter."
